            "description": "",
            "summary": "Apogee Enterprises (APOG) saw its earnings grow at an average rate of 23.9% annually over the past five years, but the most recent net profit margin fell to 3.2%, down from 7.6% a year ago. The latest figures were impacted by a one-off $47.6 million loss, which weighed on reported profitability even as forward-looking earnings growth is forecast to accelerate by an impressive 47.5% per year. With shares trading below estimated fair value and the company offering a lower price-to-earnings...",
